    "long_instructions": "## Now Playing\r\n\r\n1. Plan: In `documentation.md`, decide:\r\n   - your function name\r\n   - what it does\r\n   - what inputs it takes  \r\n2. Write a function using your chosen name that takes in two parameters.\r\n\r\n3. Build a “Now Playing” message using the parameters.\r\n\r\n4. Display the message on screen.\r\n\r\n5. Call your function inside the event listener so it runs when the button is clicked.\r\n\r\n_Challenge: Add another input to include one more detail about the show._",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Code a function that takes in two parameters and updates the display with a Now Playing message.",
